+ `muted`: `#14171a` (string, required) - A colour as `#rrggbb`.
+ `accent`: `#14171a` (string, required) - A colour as `#rrggbb`.
+ `accentText`: `#14171a` (string, required) - A colour as `#rrggbb`.


## Photo (object)
One photo.

### Properties
+ `id`: `LFRvGuTU3D8i334X` (string, required) - The photo's id, for `getImage`, `setPhotoOrder` and colour matching.
+ `url`: `/api/blobs/LFRvGuTU3D8i334X` (string, required) - Public image URL on this site.


## Shipping (object)
Shipping cost and destinations.

### Properties
+ `amount`: `15` (number, required) - Shipping cost per order.
+ `currency`: `USD` (string, required) - ISO 4217 currency code.
+ `ships_to`: `["US","CA"]` (array[string], required) - Country codes; empty means anywhere PayPal ships.


## ShipTo (object)
Where it ships, from the buyer's PayPal checkout. Null if PayPal didn't share it.

### Properties
+ `name`: `Sam Rivera` (string, optional, nullable) - The recipient's name.
+ `address`: `1 Main St, Springfield, IL, 62701, US` (string, optional) - The address on one line.


## Shop1 (object)
The shop the order belongs to.

### Properties
+ `slug`: `vintageskates` (string, optional) - The shop's link name.
+ `name`: `Vintage Cream and Red Roller Skates` (string, optional) - The product's name.
+ `url`: `https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates` (string, optional) - The shop page.


## ShopPhotos (object)
The shop's photos.

### Properties
+ `photos` (array[Photo], required) - Every photo, the cover first.


## Tracking (object)
The carrier and tracking number once shipped; null before.

### Properties
+ `carrier`: `USPS` (string, optional) - The shipping carrier.
+ `number`: `9400111899223197428490` (string, optional) - The tracking number.


## Variant (object)
One combination of option values.

### Properties
+ `choice`: `{"Size":"M","Color":"Black"}` (string, required) - The buyer's pick, one value per option, keyed by option name.
+ `availability`: `in_stock (3 left)` (string, required) - `in_stock`, `in_stock (N left)` or `sold_out`.
+ `order_url`: `https://one-thing-ash0.onrender.com/vintageskates/buy?Size=9` (string, optional) - `orderByLink` for this pick. Left out when it's sold out.

